/Title (8. Proposed Methodology  The proposed methodology describes the step-by-step process used to develop the Multi-Sample Disagreement-Based Toxicity Detection System for Hinglish Social Media Text. The system uses Artificial Intelligence \(AI\), Natural Language Processing \(NLP\), and transformer-based deep learning models to detect toxic comments more accurately. Instead of relying on a single prediction, the system compares multiple predictions and uses their level of agreement to make a more reliable final decision.)
